Package: fnware
Title: Ready-Made Function Decorators
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Dyfan", "Jones", , "dyfan.r.jones@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Ready-made function decorators for R, built on the 'adorn'
    framework. Covers resilience (retrying, timeouts, rate limiting, circuit
    breaking and fallbacks), caching, call logging, context
    managers and argument validation, with asynchronous versions for
    functions that return promises.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://dyfanjones.github.io/fnware/, https://github.com/DyfanJones/fnware
BugReports: https://github.com/DyfanJones/fnware/issues
